  90:  * client refreshing itself, and this repository ships none â€” but its type declarations describe a
  91:  * BROWSER: they reach for `Window`, `CloseEvent`, `PublicKeyCredential` and a dozen other DOM names.
  92:  * `tests/at/tsconfig.json` deliberately holds `lib: ["ES2022"]` with no DOM, and equally
  93:  * deliberately keeps `skipLibCheck` FALSE â€” its own comment says why, and neither is a knob this
  94:  * suite may turn to make one test body compile.
